{"current_stage":"Read the current goal to understand what needs to be done.", "remaining_steps":["Select evidence for the CURRENT goal and remaining steps.", "Newer corrections supersede old values. Preserve exact names, dates and numbers. Never select plan  ", "Do not invent facts or future tasks. No chain of thought.", "Entire JSON must fit assessment_ref_tokens."],"missing_data":[],"selected_facts":[{"text":"Sandra travelled to the kitchen.","source_ids":["c001","c001"]},{"text":"The Ealdorman has been killed; two of his followers have fled, one on the Ealdorman's horse, and every word that is put into the mouth of his faithful companions turns upon the personal tie between them and their lord.","source_ids":["c001","c001","c001"]},{"text":"There was fallen The folk's Elder, Æthelred's Earl; All there saw Of his hearth's comrades That their lord lay dead.","source_ids":["c001","c001","c001"]},{"text":"Then one of the Thegns speaks; “Neither on that folk Shall the Thanes twit me That I from this host Away would go To seek my home, Now mine Elder lieth Hewn down in battle; To me is that harm most; He was both my kinsman And my lord.”","source_ids":["c001","c001"]},{"text":"Then another speaks in answer; “How thou, Ælfwine, hast All our Thanes In need-time cheered. Now our lord lieth The Earl on the earth That of us each one Others should embolden Warmen to the war That while we weapons may Have and hold, The hard falchion Spear and good sword.”","source_ids":["c001","c001"]},{"text":"Then another speaks; “I this promise That I hence nill Flee a footstep But will further go To wreak in the fight My lord and comrade. Nor by Stourmere Any steadfast hero With words need twit me That I lordless Homeward should go And wend from the fight.”","source_ids":["c001","c001"]},{"text":"The story goes on a little later; “Rath was in battle Offa hewn down Yet had he furthered That his lord had pledged As he ere agreed With his ring-giver That they should both To the borough ride Hale to home Or in the host cringe On the slaughter place Of their wounds die. He lay thane-like His lord hard by.”","source_ids":["c001","c001"]}, {"text": "Newer corrections supersede old values.", "source_ids": ["c001"]}

